{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.rinze.letter",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "她接过你的大衣",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.rinze.letter",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.rinze.letter",
    "idolId": "rinze",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶，认可偶像活动……？",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "是……杜野家，本来并不认可凛世的活动……我说想当偶像的时候，那可真是大骚动……",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这、这样啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "但是……无论如何……都想知道。制作人大人，会把凛世带到哪里去……",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "让家里人……稍微担心了……",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "凛世…………原来有这样的内情啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "是……但是，我一点也不后悔。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "制作人大人，把凛世……带到最好的舞台上去了。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "那一天，和制作人大人相遇，是命运。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，我也这么想。不过，让凛世走到这里的，是凛世自己的力量。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "正因为有您在，才做得到……感谢您，制作人大人。家里人，也这么说……",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不不，不用谢…………话说……家里人，也……信里也提到我了？",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "……写信回家时，尽是写您的事……所以……想见见您，他们这么说……",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "如果可以……能请您，见见凛世的家人吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（『W.I.N.G.』的优胜报告……吧……得准备句像样的问候才行。）",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "制作人大人……！凛世……很幸福……"
      },
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "辛苦了。我回来了。呼……好，得整理报告书……",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "大衣，我帮您收下……",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，你已经来了啊，凛世。谢谢。不过那种事不用在意也行哦？",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "凛世，想这么做……现在，去给您泡茶。",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不，不能麻烦你做这种事……不过，谢谢你的心意。",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……嗯？",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "那是……老家寄来的信。",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哦，这样啊……写了些什么？",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "是……说认可凛世的偶像活动……正好，想跟您说……",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
